#describe what Duplicated unit tests in five groups now live in one place each; a new hygiene test covers every workflow file.
#describe before Pin, runner and pnpm checks repeated per workflow test; extension refusals and install guards asserted at several layers.
#describe after One parametrised workflow-hygiene test; one refusal set at the config layer; install guards in lantern-bundle only.
#describe verified pnpm run typecheck, pnpm run lint and pnpm test are green; the hygiene test fails on an unpinned action.
