#reason test/workflow-hygiene.test.ts One hygiene check over every workflow file replaces the pin, runner and pnpm checks repeated per file.
#reason test/ci-workflow.test.ts Pin, runner and pnpm checks moved to the hygiene test; run-string copies dropped.
#reason test/command-palette-items.test.ts The Category: Title label is pinned once in the commands registry test.
#reason test/deploy-docs-workflow.test.ts Keeps only permission, secret and deploy-from-main checks; shared hygiene and config copies dropped.
#reason test/extensions-panel.test.ts The reviewer-slot locked refusal is already asserted by the config layer and the panel table.
#reason test/extensions-project.test.ts Full refusal set lives at the config layer, so the project layer keeps one case per behaviour it owns.
#reason test/install-skills.test.ts Install guards are asserted once in lantern-bundle, which owns the behaviour; the CLI keeps its output wording.
#reason test/lantern-always-on-skills.test.ts Per-skill refusal loop duplicated the config layer; the list-agreement checks stay.
#reason test/macro-legend-view.test.ts Dashed-outline meaning is asserted once in the legend unit test, not again in the mounted view.
#reason test/macro-legend.test.ts The solid-outline uses check is subsumed by the single-dashed-rule check.
#story A maintainer changes a workflow
#step actor A maintainer
#file test/workflow-hygiene.test.ts
#file test/ci-workflow.test.ts
#step action edits any workflow file
#step subject the repository checks
#below actor A maintainer
#below interaction sees one failing hygiene check naming the file
#below consequence The same rule failed in several test files => The same rule fails once
#story A maintainer breaks an install or extension rule
#step actor A maintainer
#file test/extensions-project.test.ts
#file test/install-skills.test.ts
#step action breaks a refusal or install guard
#step subject the unit tests
#below actor A maintainer
#below interaction sees the test of the layer that owns the rule fail
#below consequence Many copies failed at once => One test fails
